Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:54.35,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,相當有感覺　無敵的POWER！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.71,0:00:57.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,真的感覺不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:01:00.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.13,0:01:04.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,來　向著明天前進吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:18.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,只要接觸就能了解　心的極限
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:21.91,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:25.50,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes! Change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:28.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,激烈的戰鬥　不管多少次都要嘗試！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:32.20,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,貫徹真實
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:35.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐！　所以不會輸！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.42,0:01:38.39,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,驚險刺激最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:45.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣開始照亮世界的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:51.94,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,充滿你給予的奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:58.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,將不似任何人的笑容作為榮耀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.92,0:02:03.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,現在超越未來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.47,0:02:07.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,We can try over the future world!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:08.22,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:09.63,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,最大 !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:12.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,大膽 !
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:16.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 你是我命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.29,0:22:16.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.52,0:22:37.02,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,在你面前的話　你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:44.16,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連超能力也派不上用場
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.45,0:22:50.65,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連畢達哥拉斯　也無法弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:53.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,戀愛是智慧之輪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:23:00.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,一副要哭的樣子　低著頭是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.76,0:23:05.62,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有笑容　才能產生奇蹟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.13,0:23:07.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,DA DA 命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.56,0:23:07.86,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,啾啾 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.86,0:23:08.86,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想把你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.86,0:23:09.28,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨嗨 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:13.13,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,變成大膽無敵的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:17.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓人無比沉醉　這是真的　絕對的 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.22,0:23:18.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,DA DA 大變身
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.61,0:23:18.95,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,啾啾 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.95,0:23:19.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,給你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.90,0:23:20.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨嗨 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.53,0:23:25.41,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,爆炸性的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.50,0:23:28.31,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你能喜歡　絕對 !
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.31,0:23:33.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 你是我命中注定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.00,0:23:38.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為 你是我命中注定的人
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.18,0:00:25.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  齧齒類
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,齧齒類  在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎  你偶爾也洗一下毛皮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.15,0:00:35.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直都沒洗過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:40.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明告訴過它不要擅自外出走動的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:42.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終究是齧齒類嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,種子啊…我喜歡向日葵的種子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(660,570)\fad(500,500)}20th sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:25.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(760,600)\fad(500,500)}「超獸戲畫！有時像野獸一樣…」
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:25.02,zhushi - 2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs18}註：音同“鳥獣戯画”，由日本漫畫界的祖師爺鳥羽僧正覺猶所繪\N被日本政府列為四大國寶繪卷\N戲畫：基本等同與漫畫\N超獸：以前和超人力霸王-艾斯，戰鬥過的異次元人亞波人運用地球的動植物和宇宙生物\N合成的怪獸兵器，這裡大概是指桃太郎為合成動物之意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  這是最好吃的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  多好的女孩  是我喜歡的那類
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.19,0:02:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是被抓起來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.19,0:02:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在就放你出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那算什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.15,0:02:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是多好的女孩  頭腦跟老鼠一樣低級我可不要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.80,0:03:24.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L 1  出發準備完成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.21,0:03:26.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請到第二機庫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.06,0:03:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  我們就出發去進行The Hound的強化訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切都交給你了  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在大自然中錘鍊兩人的野性吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:37.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,錘鍊  野性
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:41.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油哦  明君  初音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.29,0:03:42.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我會努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛  好痛  初音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柏木小姐  那些傢伙今晚就…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Children你就不用擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思  那就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.87,0:03:55.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請走好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.18,0:04:17.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朧小姐要來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:19.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我預感會有H漫畫的展開
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來很開心啊  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.69,0:04:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在期待些什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.65,0:04:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是兵部少佐的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.97,0:04:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相當衰弱的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:35.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶回家裡去照顧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.36,0:04:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但這是兵部少佐的鼯鼠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事  不用在意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs24}Metamorphose{\r}\N變身
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.39,0:04:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  初音君
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.87,0:04:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變身變得純熟了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.87,0:04:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(564,660)}Metamorphose
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.31,0:04:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明君那邊如何
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,憑依也很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(577,660)}Replace
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生  森林中好像有什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.44,0:05:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建築物…  是廢墟嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是戰前陸軍的防空洞嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:23.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.78,0:05:35.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.82,0:05:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:38.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.70,0:05:48.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此  是在進行改造動物  使它們具備超能力的實驗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中有一個蓋子打開了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.25,0:06:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它會喝嗎  砂糖水
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  喝了喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過小心點  血糖值已經上升了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:21.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果意識清晰了的話  它…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.13,0:06:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實驗成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過性情這麼粗暴…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  運送到敵區讓它去大鬧就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是敵人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊  桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎？！  那是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要對我做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它失去最近的記憶了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連我們都不記得了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:53.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是喪失記憶嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.31,0:06:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼  你這混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:56.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  要忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它現在很混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要讓它知道現在沒什麼好怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.53,0:07:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經不痛了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.06,0:07:13.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對  很痛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不可怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:21.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.60,0:07:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到這裡就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好·痛——！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.96,0:07:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎  你們也是超能力者啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.05,0:07:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼接下來要怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.05,0:07:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該去還給兵部先生的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.70,0:07:45.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部？  那是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  就在這裡飼養吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:51.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然沒有最近的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:53.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起還給兵部先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:57.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得在這裡作為普通的鼯鼠來養要更加幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:08:00.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話雖如此  但它不是普通的鼯鼠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先皆本先生就不可能答應的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不被他發現飼養是辦不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上好  我來打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是朧小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:13.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.45,0:08:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會被發現的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.03,0:08:18.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家在哪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:22.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？  現在就洗澡了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為朧小姐要來  所以我們想先把身子洗乾淨
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又在打什麼壞主意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是女孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.26,0:08:35.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的  我要做飯了  你們快點出來哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  一點都不可怕  一起洗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.04,0:08:57.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  我拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.68,0:08:58.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全力拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用不著強迫它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也沒什麼氣味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話雖如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  朧小姐已經來了  我們都在做些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別說「我們」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:19.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朧小姐～
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,H漫畫  H漫畫  H漫畫  H漫畫  H漫畫  H漫畫！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.25,0:09:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起H漫畫  不對  是一起洗澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.35,0:09:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼不好吧  一起濕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:31.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起洗吧  快脫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.78,0:09:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離開薰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.58,0:09:36.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離開薰  人類
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:36.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.83,0:09:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那是兵部少佐的…？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然因為不得了的發現而中止了訓練
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不介意的話  不如到我家來吃個晚餐怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  飯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我很樂意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朧小姐應該已經準備了大餐的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  初音君
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和剛才的氣味  一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.49,0:10:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才…你是指今天發現的實驗設施嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:11.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  紫穗  葵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離開薰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.49,0:10:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.40,0:10:26.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也是同夥嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.97,0:10:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者  The Children
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動用力量制壓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(559,660)}Psychic
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總算是抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.37,0:11:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼接下來怎麼做  薰…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小…小薰  浴巾  浴巾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:22.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}めっちゃ　うま～{\r}\N超級好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.66,0:11:27.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}またまた　このあと大変なことに！{\r}\N接下來還有不得了的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喪失記憶？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:33.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吶  皆本  不能在這裡養嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為它是實驗動物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實驗動物？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:41.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是為了戰爭而人工製造的超能力者的倖存者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是說它是被強行變成超能力者的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.34,0:11:51.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.49,0:11:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世上的國家都在進行同樣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:12:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它擁有能夠將空氣像導彈一樣射擊的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然很可憐  但它實在太過危險了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能在B.A.B.E.L的嚴密管理下保護起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.21,0:12:09.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本  你會想辦法的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.11,0:12:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要做無理的請求  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能這麼做了吧  不要讓皆本先生為難
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.45,0:12:23.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是思念波攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要慌  這樣的高輸出持續不了多久的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:29.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然敢騙我  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.06,0:12:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的  桃太郎  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你欺騙我  還把我抓起來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.25,0:12:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.65,0:12:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明  你居然把明給…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.67,0:12:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臭人類  臭人類  臭人類
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.86,0:12:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點制止它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著  桃太郎沒有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.19,0:12:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明的仇  打倒  玩弄到死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:12:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  初音  我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:00.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  薰  由我去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要待在明君的身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.91,0:13:06.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這由朧小姐來…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.45,0:13:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按我說的做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.41,0:13:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它既然讓人類負傷了  那就沒有選擇餘地了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放棄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.72,0:13:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的意思是要殺死桃太郎嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將它改造成超能力者並想利用它的明明是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.99,0:13:24.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不能放置危險的動物不管
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果這是獅子或者老虎的話  你也能夠明白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本你因為是普通人所以才能這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.33,0:13:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你自己從來沒被當成是獅子或者老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是為了教授猛獸禮儀的魔法的戒指
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖聽話我就幫你們拿掉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是不是超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:52.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不還只是小女孩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不是猛獸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.53,0:13:57.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是人類重要的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:14:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而保護這重要的未來就是我們大人的義務
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你像那個時候一樣也保護桃太郎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:11.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼不肯說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.20,0:14:14.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「沒事的  用不著擔心」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「交給我吧」這種的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柏木小姐  向B.A.B.E.L要求出動特殊部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:22.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陰溝老鼠  居然敢把明…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.09,0:14:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得手了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.84,0:14:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大…大姐頭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.76,0:14:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明的事實在對不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是住手吧  初音
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.27,0:14:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但…但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:50.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要出手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:53.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是你打算怎麼做  小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們離遠點  我會想辦法的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.49,0:15:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你欺騙了我  你欺騙了我  背叛了我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.75,0:15:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這樣的  我也是稍微能夠理解你的心情的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.44,0:15:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.26,0:15:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙根本沒打算避開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦  囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.34,0:15:20.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我受到同樣對待的話  也可能做出同樣的舉動啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.32,0:15:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那幫傢伙  這完全是反亂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:36.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起  如果我早點察覺的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:37.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果當我沒受過傷的話
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能想點什麼辦法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:44.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明君
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.98,0:15:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想用憑依奪取桃太郎的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.98,0:15:48.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(565.,660)}Replace
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.56,0:15:51.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是防禦太強而失敗了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過那個時候它的感情傳遞了過來…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:16:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它原本是被研究人員培養的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:04.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且被信任的人背叛  它感到很憤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:10.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但反言之  這不正說明它對人類還有依戀嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果小薰做的好的話  它可能會再次相信人類的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音也經常會讓我受這種程度的傷的  痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  她們將桃太郎和自己重疊起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.27,0:16:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.89,0:16:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變得有趣起來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為超能力不是魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.91,0:16:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以稍微會有點痛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斷了的骨頭應該已經連起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也幫幫你們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給你  就用這個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:52.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:55.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓緊點比較好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.73,0:16:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拖拖拉拉的話  你就會錯過看我對女王…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:17:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…對薰君做你無法對她做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:16.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.09,0:17:20.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真拿你沒轍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下就交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  你用不著擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然是我們的女王
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:29.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\pos(753,660)}Queen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.39,0:17:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會讓你悲傷的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為憎恨人類而悲傷透了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:45.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不發洩在誰身上的話  胸口就好像要被撕裂一般吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.82,0:17:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.19,0:17:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是代替你做你想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來啊  我來當你的對手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.11,0:18:00.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你無法原諒吧  全部發洩出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.89,0:18:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  就是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:10.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也…曾認為自己是人類…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以為大家而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我相信祖國和同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以在我明白這都是假的那天…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.66,0:18:25.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕不會忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你一樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:37.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家  沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.64,0:18:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仔細看著  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能夠理解超能力者內心的就只有超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部先生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.59,0:19:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太煩了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經到極限了嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我適可而止吧  你個小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為是誰讓你醒過來的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.61,0:19:11.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再不停止的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心我抽你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前的事情你要生氣到什麼時候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少佐  這樣說的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦  人類
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙在幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是他自己說「來吧」的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:30.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我  你這混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒絕  要放你先放
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  你先放
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.86,0:19:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兩人…都不是認真的了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像…狗或者狐狸的兄弟吵架一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.54,0:19:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道…那傢伙故意…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.77,0:19:47.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:50.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總讓人操心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.34,0:19:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於想起來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:55.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,京介！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.60,0:19:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真木
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:20:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也同樣讓人操心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,累死了  回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.90,0:20:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.99,0:20:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能就這樣讓你走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:10.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:14.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我和桃太郎都是社會的威脅嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.09,0:20:17.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這是為了誰的社會？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不介意的  開槍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:23.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後讓這些孩子們看看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被社會排擠的人的下場
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,承蒙你照顧了  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.21,0:20:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.28,0:20:54.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果薰你希望的話  我可以隨時背叛那LOLI控的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這齧齒類  要忘恩負義到什麼地步啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:20:59.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  再見
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.00,0:21:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  給我站住  齧齒類
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.58,0:21:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見  桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.67,0:21:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  不一起坐上來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乘朧小姐的車
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的  皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.67,0:21:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.51,0:21:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她只是稍微冷靜一下頭腦而已
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.11,0:21:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是到最後都沒有開槍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.35,0:21:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.67,0:21:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生  謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝  你們倆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.40,0:21:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要  不能碰這裡～
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.26,0:21:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家的浴室不是壞了嘛～
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  你趁亂在摸什麼地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.30,0:21:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以去朧小姐你家不是H漫畫的自然流程嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.66,0:22:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是你搭乘這邊的理由？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.54,0:22:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是如此～
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.05,0:23:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.15,0:23:46.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的錯覺嗎  這幾天好像一直被誰盯著一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.67,0:23:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像被人跟蹤了一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.03,0:23:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟是誰  為什麼要跟蹤柏木小姐呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:52.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柏木朧  她的私生活完全是謎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.15,0:23:54.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那神秘的面紗就由我…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.53,0:23:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.03,0:23:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第21話  「器用貧乏！他為什麼生氣呢？！」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.03,0:23:59.33,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,（器用貧乏是諺語，意為“身通百藝，潦倒一生”）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.57,0:24:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九具津君  我很信任你的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  我今後也會和小莫佳一起努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.89,0:24:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

